WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:18.643
Wow! Who are you?

2
00:00:18.644 --> 00:00:22.408
I'm an octopus.

3
00:00:22.409 --> 00:00:26.966
Octopuses are mollusks.

4
00:00:26.967 --> 00:00:34.019
Mollusks have soft bodies and no bones.

5
00:00:34.020 --> 00:00:37.299
Where do you live?

6
00:00:37.300 --> 00:00:40.975
Octopuses live in the ocean.

7
00:00:40.976 --> 00:00:45.850
We like to crawl along the ocean floor.

8
00:00:45.851 --> 00:00:49.581
You have a lot of arms!

9
00:00:49.582 --> 00:00:54.826
Yes, we have eight arms.

10
00:00:54.827 --> 00:00:59.766
Sometimes we lose an arm.

11
00:00:59.767 --> 00:01:04.168
But we can grow a new one.

12
00:01:04.169 --> 00:01:08.353
What's on your arms?

13
00:01:08.354 --> 00:01:12.019
These are suckers.

14
00:01:12.020 --> 00:01:16.279
Our suckers can grab things.

15
00:01:16.280 --> 00:01:20.523
We can even taste with them!

16
00:01:20.524 --> 00:01:23.368
What do you eat?

17
00:01:23.369 --> 00:01:28.477
We really like clams and crabs.

18
00:01:28.478 --> 00:01:33.338
Some big octopuses eat sharks!

19
00:01:33.339 --> 00:01:38.399
Seals and big fish often eat us.

20
00:01:38.400 --> 00:01:41.788
How do you protect yourself?

21
00:01:41.789 --> 00:01:45.893
We can change color and shape.

22
00:01:45.894 --> 00:01:53.028
That helps us hide.

23
00:01:53.029 --> 00:02:01.360
We can also shoot ink.

24
00:02:01.361 --> 00:02:04.175
How do you swim?

25
00:02:04.176 --> 00:02:08.315
We use the water to move backward.

26
00:02:08.316 --> 00:02:18.431
First we suck in water.

27
00:02:18.432 --> 00:02:24.118
Then we shoot the water out and—zoom!

28
00:02:24.119 --> 00:02:28.474
Good-bye!

29
00:02:28.475 --> 00:02:35.483
Good-bye, Octopus!
